---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Notes — Yun Lambert" description="技术笔记历史归档：二维码原理与 Git 常用命令。">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">NOTES / ARCHIVE / FIELD SIGNALS</p>
    <h1>Notes from<br />the deep.</h1>
    <p>早期写下的技术探索，按原文归档。这里的内容不代表当前建议；阅读时请留意日期与醒目的历史说明。</p>
  </header>
  <section class="notes-page-list" aria-label="Archived notes">
    <div class="archive-notice">
      <Icon name="spark" size={21} />
      <div>
        <strong>历史归档</strong>
        <p>文章保留原始正文、表述与命令，仅重新排版。涉及工具操作时，请先核对最新官方文档。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="notes-preview">
      <a class="note-row" href="/notes/git-commands/">
        <span class="note-meta">2020.01.24 / SHARE</span>
        <div>
          <h2>Git 的一些常用命令</h2>
          <p>分支、remote、rebase、reset 与恢复场景笔记。</p>
        </div>
        <Icon name="arrow" size={21} />
      </a>
      <a class="note-row" href="/notes/qr-code/">
        <span class="note-meta">2019.01.15 / SHARE</span>
        <div>
          <h2>深度探索二维码及其应用</h2>
          <p>二维码数据编码、纠错、掩码与艺术化实现。</p>
        </div>
        <Icon name="arrow" size={21} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .note-row h2 {
    margin: 0 0 5px;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.55rem);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
